[version]
1.7.1
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- REMOVED: gnome.lua, xfce.lua, plasma.lua (3 legacy DEs deleted!)
  - Only gui.lua and tty.lua remain
  - Cleaner codebase, less disk space used
  - installer MANIFEST updated (no more legacy DE downloads)
  - installer DE choice simplified: 1=gui, 2=tty
  - help.lua updated to show only gui and tty
- FIX: Installer self-update check now properly compares versions
  - INSTALLER_VERSION constant = "2.0.0" (was "1.0")
  - If repo has newer installer.lua, asks to update before installing
  - This ensures users always get the latest installer
[/whatsnew]
